{"product_id":"the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-8-volume-8-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-8","title":"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, Vol. 8 (Volume 8) (The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, 8)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKonoha Satou featured herself as the main character in her self-indulgent fantasy romance fic, Dark History. But since becoming its most reprehensible villainess, remembering every single little detail is the only way she can survive! Both Konoha and Isaac were chosen as candidates for sainthood. However, to stop the plot of her Dark History, Satou chooses Team Isaac! For their first trial, the candidates must receive a sacred beast’s blessing. It has a special love for virgins, but wait―is the body Satou’s wearing even still a virgin? If that being kills her for Iana’s impurity, maybe she can avoid a public execution, at least...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Akiharu Touka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781975362294\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434484588697,"sku":"Manga-A-39781975362294","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b244d87293-The-Dark-History-of-the-Reincarnated-Villainess-Vol-8-Volume-8-The-Dark-History-of_8312_1.jpg?v=1753121613","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-8-volume-8-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-8","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}